{
    "title": "US Taxi Car Parking Simulator",
    "description": "You can become the king of the road in the most realistic US Taxi Car parking Simulator. Experience the real life of a taxi driver in this immersive parking game. Its combination of driving simulation, time management, and customer service.\r\n\r\nKey features of US Taxi Car Driving Simulator:\r\n\u2022\tSwitch to taxi front view with a simple tap\r\n\u2022\tSelect controls by staring at the taxi games\r\n\u2022\tSwipe left/right to move the taxi\r\n\u2022\tCheck points add refreshing breaks to your journey\r\n\r\n<b>Training Mode</b>: \r\nFollow the clear road arrows in this taxi games to reach your passengers' destinations, and learn about their lives, their jobs, and their families along the way.\r\n\r\n<b>Career Modes of taxi games</b>:\r\n Step of the taxi driver in this challenging and rewarding mode! Answer incoming calls from passengers and pick them up and drop them off using car parking maps instructions. \r\n\r\n<b>Time Trail Mode</b>: \r\nYou must be fast and secure because taxi driver has to fix time to pick and drop off your passengers. \r\n\r\n<b>3d Graphics</b>: Stunning graphics and power staring options make this taxi driver games the most realistic and immersive experience on the market of VIP Clint\u2019s.\r\n\r\n<b> Functions of taxi simulator</b>: \r\nit\u2019s a Perfect city cab career mode for taxi simulator as ultimate taxi driver and car driving game.\r\n\r\nExperience the thrill and challenge of 3D taxi game in 4 unique modes. Taxi Games: City Car Parking, challenge yourself for master 5 unique levels. You're providing a valuable service of taxi game to your community. Taxi driving game help people get where they need to go in the most fun and rewarding way possible.\r\nCar parking games are also a great way to explore different cities and cultures, so keep playing and discover new places. Taxi simulator and parking games are a fun and engaging way to experience the world of taxi driving.",
    "descriptionHTML": "You can become the king of the road in the most realistic US Taxi Car parking Simulator. Experience the real life of a taxi driver in this immersive parking game. Its combination of driving simulation, time management, and customer service.<br><br>Key features of US Taxi Car Driving Simulator:<br>\u2022\tSwitch to taxi front view with a simple tap<br>\u2022\tSelect controls by staring at the taxi games<br>\u2022\tSwipe left/right to move the taxi<br>\u2022\tCheck points add refreshing breaks to your journey<br><br><b>Training Mode</b>: <br>Follow the clear road arrows in this taxi games to reach your passengers&#39; destinations, and learn about their lives, their jobs, and their families along the way.<br><br><b>Career Modes of taxi games</b>:<br> Step of the taxi driver in this challenging and rewarding mode! Answer incoming calls from passengers and pick them up and drop them off using car parking maps instructions. <br><br><b>Time Trail Mode</b>: <br>You must be fast and secure because taxi driver has to fix time to pick and drop off your passengers. <br><br><b>3d Graphics</b>: Stunning graphics and power staring options make this taxi driver games the most realistic and immersive experience on the market of VIP Clint\u2019s.<br><br><b> Functions of taxi simulator</b>: <br>it\u2019s a Perfect city cab career mode for taxi simulator as ultimate taxi driver and car driving game.<br><br>Experience the thrill and challenge of 3D taxi game in 4 unique modes. Taxi Games: City Car Parking, challenge yourself for master 5 unique levels. You&#39;re providing a valuable service of taxi game to your community. Taxi driving game help people get where they need to go in the most fun and rewarding way possible.<br>Car parking games are also a great way to explore different cities and cultures, so keep playing and discover new places. Taxi simulator and parking games are a fun and engaging way to experience the world of taxi driving.",
